{"availability":"available","full":"JatinSharma496/AI_Predictive_Models_for_Credit_Underwriting","name":"AI_Predictive_Models_for_Credit_Underwriting","description":"This repository contains a machine learning-based predictive model for automating loan eligibility assessments. Using features such as demographic details, loan information, and credit history, the model predicts whether a loan should be approved or denied.","category":"Education","language":"Jupyter Notebook","stars":7,"forks":4,"created":"2024-11-26T12:40:52Z","updated":"2025-08-27T07:14:20Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://jatinsharma496-ai-predictive-models-for-loan-default-prediction.streamlit.app/","topics":["ai","chatbot","credit-underwriting","flask","gemini","genai","groq","lightgbm","loan-prediction","machine-learning","predictive-modeling","streamlit","web-application"],"demo":"https://jatinsharma496-ai-predictive-models-for-loan-default-prediction.streamlit.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:24:54.430Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T21:24:54.430Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T21:24:54.430Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T16:33:02.982Z","stars":7,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-08T21:24:54.430Z","stars":7,"forks":4}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This project automates the prediction of loan defaults based on applicant details, financial history, and loan attributes using machine learning models. The system includes feature importance analysis, model training, and a user-friendly Flask API and Streamlit web application for real-time predictions. A chatbot has also been integrated for seamless interaction.","Loan default prediction is a critical task for financial institutions to reduce risks. This project automates the prediction of whether a loan will default based on various applicant details, loan features, and credit history, providing quick and accurate predictions to assist lenders in their